  notesText: "If you want your GUI to support multiple screen ratios, or if you just
    want to make it easier to shift things around during development, avoid using
    fixed offsets in the RectTransform fields.  \n\nKeep things like \"Left\" and
    \"Bottom\" set to zero, and use anchors to position your GUI objects relative
    to their parent's rectangle.\n\nSee the TopBar child object for more."
